{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415665","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415665","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041566501:0":{"text":"우와. 여기서 패션 감각 있는 사람을 만나다니, 드문 일이네!","source_cn":"哇哦，真难得，在这里能碰上懂时尚的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x019B6F424FE0B14D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566502:0":{"text":"너도 멋진데? 이렇게 스타일을 아는 사람을 만나니 반갑네!","source_cn":"你也不错啊，难得能见到打扮品味一致的朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A90FC00105DF7C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566503:0":{"text":"평소에 어디서 놀아? 아센 사막에 오면 라이스라는 이름을 기억하라고!","source_cn":"你混哪边的？你要是到荒角沙漠这边，就报我诡草的大名！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF949B80C6135DAD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566504:0":{"text":"나? 난 어디든 다 가. 배고프면 돈 좀 벌고, 아니면 노는 거지!","source_cn":"我？我哪里都逛逛，饿了就挣点钱，不饿就玩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FA2B3B7DA8CD62B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566505:0":{"text":"사막이라... 거긴 햇살도 너무 강하고 모래 밖에 없잖아. 그리고 팡팡이 그쪽엔 성가신 녀석이 있다고 했는데...","source_cn":"沙漠啊，太晒了吧，又到处都是沙子，而且阿爆说那边有个烦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC8099FB0351A6E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566506:0":{"text":"걱정 마. 사막엔 내가 있으니까 시비 거는 놈들은 다 막아줄게!","source_cn":"你放心，在沙漠有我在，不管什么人找麻烦都不用怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50479DE9B7C6296C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566507:0":{"text":"오면 내가 블레이즈 윙 태워줄게! 이 녀석은 사막에서 제일 빠르다고!","source_cn":"到时候我带你坐坐炽翼冲锋者，他可是全沙漠速度第一！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D37E75AC78678E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566508:0":{"text":"와! 이게 블레이즈 윙이야? 넌 탈것 이름도 멋지네!","source_cn":"哦！这就是炽翼冲锋者吗？你给坐骑起的名字也很帅啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56EBD48925D9E2DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566509:0":{"text":"단순한 탈것이 아니야. 이 녀석은 내 형제고 동료고 친구거든!","source_cn":"不止是坐骑，还是我的哥们儿，伙伴，朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39F5EA0420141DD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566510:0":{"text":"알지, 알지! 나도 그런 친구가 있어. 팡팡이라고 해!","source_cn":"我明白我明白，我也有这样的好朋友！就是我刚刚说的阿爆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCF0DFA818DA9C7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566511:0":{"text":"센스도 있고 의리도 있고... 요즘 세상에 너 같은 사람은 흔하지 않은데!","source_cn":"你不仅懂时尚，还懂义气！如今这样的人越来越少见了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F720D127349F79D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566512:0":{"text":"맨날 이상한 복장이라고 시끄럽게 떠드는 노인네들은 패션의 ㅍ도 모르잖아!","source_cn":"那帮烦人的老家伙一天到晚说什么奇装异服的，根本不懂时尚嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83430BBFA3CB7D70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041566513:0":{"text":"맞아! 언젠가 꼭 그 구닥다리 늙은이들의 입을 막아버려야 하는데!","source_cn":"没错！总有一天，得让那帮过时的老家伙们闭嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2E22765CC08D139","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:库露露":{"text":"쿠루루","source":"库露露","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:诡草":{"text":"라이스","source":"诡草","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}